                             115\t        *   Pin 1: GND.\n   116\t        *   Pin 2: `NFAULT` (Schematic) / \"FAULTn\" (Text).\n                 
                             117\t        *   Pin 3: `RX_C` (Schematic) / \"RX\" (Text).\n   118\t        *   Pin 4: `TX` (Schematic)             
                             / \"TX\" (Text).\n   119\t        *   **Conflict:** The text description for J3 pins 4 and 5 (\"4 RX\",              
                             \"5 TX\") contradicts the schematic wires (Pin 4 is `TX`, Pin 3 is `RX_C`). The schematic wires are                  
